      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MUSTANG ELEANOR (1) showed good early burn and was there until turning but swamped late to finish 6th at this track in a Grade 5. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. ASTON MONSOON (3) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 4 lengths (20.00) at Healesville. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. TAKE A JAGUAR (2) was below best at his last start when 7th at Traralgon following a third place finish (20.57) there two back. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and five minor placings to his credit. Should be in this for a long way. ",
